  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": "\"surgery\": many languages use one word for the medical treatment and a separate word for the British meaning *a doctor's place of work*.",
    "grammar": "\"surgery\": uncountable in *have surgery* and *need surgery*, with no article; American English also counts single operations (*three surgeries*).",
